{block content}
<style>
    .registration-info {
        max-width: 900px;
        margin: 5rem auto;
        padding: 3rem 2rem;
        text-align: center;
        background: #f8f9fa;
        border-radius: 0.75rem;
    }

    .registration-info .emoji {
        font-size: 4rem;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .registration-info h2 {
        font-size: 2.2rem;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .registration-info p {
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        line-height: 1.7;
        margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    }

    .registration-info footer {
        margin-top: 2rem;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        color: #6c757d;
    }
</style>

<div class="container">
    <div class="registration-info">
        <div class="emoji"><img src="{$basePath}/logo/biodiversity_cz.svg" alt="Biodiversity.cz" height="200"></div>

        <h2>Welcome to the Herbarium Collections Repository!</h2>

        <p>
            Thank you for registering with the repository.
        </p>

        <p>
            This repository is intended for institutional herbaria and
            cannot be used by individual users.
            Please see the
            <a href="https://biodiversity-cz.github.io/herbarium-documentation/">
                documentation
            </a>
            for more information.
        </p>

        <p>
            If you are eligible to provide images from your institution's
            herbarium, please ask the main curator of your institution
            (see <a n:href=":Front:Home:contact">Contacts</a> to find out
            who is in charge) to assign your account to the appropriate herbarium.
        </p>

    </div>
</div>
